  "description": "Connector contracts for writing LoginLink plugins (OAuth, OIDC, LDAP/Directory, OTP, Password, MFA, Trusted Device, SAML, Role Sync, Geo-Location, IP Intelligence, Password Breach, configuration schema, integration guides). v1.2.0 adds ILdapConnector and IOidcConnectionRegistry (new connector kinds), SignInCategoryNames (shared sign-in method category labels), IPlatformScopeStorageCredentialsReader, ISignInPresentable (connector-owned sign-in UI), IPasswordBreachConnector, IIpIntelligenceConnector, ITestableConnector, ITenantStorageCredentialsReader, and SignInRenderContext.Embed for embeddable widget support.",
